sentences.text:
At stage of filing of charge-sheet by police, applicant shall furnish fresh bail bond of same amount before trial Court to its satisfaction subject to following conditions:-
(i) Applicant shall make herself available for interrogation by a police officer as and when required;
(ii) Applicant shall join investigation then and there and shall furnish all oral and documentary information to the Police as required by the Investigation Officer.

